    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d107">

                <pb facs="0380" n="1010" xml:id="pg1010"/>

                <head>No. 413.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General <persName corresp="#p_DES1"
                            type="from">Sickles</persName> to Mr. <persName corresp="#p_HF1"
                            type="to">Fish</persName>.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United
                                States Legation in Spain</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-07-24"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 24, 1873</date>.
                        (Received August 16.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 664.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The following is a transcript of a cable
                    message I had the honor to send you at 2 o’clock to-day: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p><persName corresp="#p_HF1"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hamilton
                                Fish</hi></persName>, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State,
                                Washington:</hi></p>
                        <p>Minister of finance of new cabinet announced yesterday in Cortes that no
                            reforms would be granted Cuba until insurgents laid down arms.
                            Announcement received with great applause.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><persName corresp="#p_DES1">SICKLES</persName>.</p>
                        <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">July</hi> 24.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><persName corresp="#p_DES1">D. E. SICKLES</persName>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
